@pavanimajety @zyongye This is now ready for review.

The scope is limited to the SM120 DeepSeek-V4.1 sparse-MLA/SWA block geometry and related tests. It overlaps with #56509, so I’d especially appreciate guidance on which implementation should be consolidated/kept rather than merging duplicate fixes.

I have real SM120 validation from 8× RTX PRO 5000, and the remaining DeepGEMM page32 dependency is tracked separately.

